.DS_Store
._.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
**/._.DS_Store
.Rproj.user

# The bulk UN SDG goal exports only (310 MB). Too large to track; the README
# documents re-downloading them. Everything else in data/01_source/ is small
# and IS tracked, including sdg_update_info.xlsx, so a fresh clone can run
# build_series_stability.R without re-downloading anything.
data/01_source/un_sdg_exports/

# Local R session files
.RData
.RDataTmp*
.Rhistory

# Local tooling and private material (kept on disk, never pushed)
.claude/
_private_archive/

# Large local-only working material (kept on disk, never pushed).
# gis_related holds ~200 MB of geopackages, one of them 133 MB — over GitHub's
# 100 MB per-file hard limit, so a `git add -A` that catches it fails the push.
# If the dashboard needs map geometry, generate a simplified iso3-keyed file
# small enough to track rather than tracking these.
gis_related/

# compIndexBuilder is a separate R package (Shiny app for building composite
# indices), not part of this analysis. Belongs in its own repository.
misc/compIndexBuilder/
misc/compIndexBuilder_*.tar.gz

# Build artifacts: knitr caches and R workspace dumps. Regenerated on knit,
# and every rerun writes a new multi-MB blob into history if tracked.
**/*_cache/
**/*_files/
*.RData
*.rdb
*.rdx

# Bifactor fit checkpoint: an intermediate the script writes every 50 cycles so
# a long run survives a closed laptop. Rebuilt by build_irt_bifactor.R.
data/02_measure/irt_goal_relative_ckpt.rds
